"major or minor release (see :doc:`Version Scheme </developer/releases/"
"version-scheme>`). The current release and past major releases are always "
"available on the `Downloads <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ page, "
"while all ISOs, including past minor releases, are available from our "
"`download mirrors <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/#mirrors>`__."
